scope the row-major ten-family run from the next door in the column-major paper; the falsifier check against its pre-run stamp; the paper, the inner-prompt revision, and this log. No change to any tracked script. No ITINERARY edit.
status GREEN for the measurements named above, read from the run's own output: the falsifier held at 13, 14, 15 and 16 sets, and the null check read clean in that output. The family-choice caveat is stated in the paper and not resolved. No code witness applies: no tracked code changed. The fresh-seed test is named and not run.
